# Release binaries are published on GitHub Releases, never committed —
# they are large, they change every build, and git has no way to prune them.
*.dmg
*.exe
*.msi
*.msix
*.deb
*.rpm
*.AppImage
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.pkg

# Keep the folder structure, the docs and the checksum files.
!.gitignore
!README.md
!*.sha256
!.gitkeep
